<title>FRANCE: France to sell 300 to 500 mln Ecu bonds Thursday.</title>
<headline>France to sell 300 to 500 mln Ecu bonds Thursday.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>France is to offer between 300 and 500 million Ecu of government bonds (OATs) at its next scheduled auction on June 12, the Treasury said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The Treasury will offer the current 10-year benchmark OAT, the 5.50 percent April 25, 2007 OAT, and the 6.75 percent April 25, 2002 OAT, both with a payment date of June 26, the statement said.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5542</p>
